{"id":"n24287-1-4","stage":3,"title":"눈싸움 · 打雪仗","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24287-1-4-1","ko":"우리 눈사람 만들고 나서 눈싸움 하자!","zh":"等我们堆完雪人之后，来打雪仗吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈사람","meaning":"雪人","explanation":"눈사람：雪人","readings":[{"term":"눈사람","audio":"/audio/b765b7708cbc78556a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41588","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들고","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"做完前一动作（-고 나서：做完……之后）","explanation":"나다：做完前一动作（-고 나서：做完……之后）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"2","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈싸움","meaning":"打雪仗","explanation":"눈싸움：打雪仗","readings":[{"term":"눈싸움","audio":"/audio/c72e3d9b697d345fb753.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24287","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈싸움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하자!","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"b765b7708cbc7855","term":"눈사람","zh":"雪人","audio":"/audio/b765b7708cbc78556a1c.mp3","entryId":"41588","definition":"把雪堆起来做成的人模样。",